WEBVTT

00:10:58.276 --> 00:11:01.316
seven years ahead of the original plan.

00:11:01.996 --> 00:11:07.996
(Applause)

00:11:07.996 --> 00:11:10.076
This is a leadership moment.

00:11:11.036 --> 00:11:14.156
It is time for us to pursue big dreams,

00:11:14.196 --> 00:11:16.596
even if they seem impossible.

00:11:17.396 --> 00:11:22.036
And it is time for us to collaborate
around the critical details

00:11:22.076 --> 00:11:26.356
so we get to a sustainable future
much, much faster.

00:11:26.916 --> 00:11:28.076
Thank you very much.

00:11:28.076 --> 00:11:29.236
(Applause)